# Normalise line endings: LF in the repository, and LF in working directories
# too. `text=auto` alone checks files out as CRLF on Windows, and Biome — which
# lints apps/web — rejects CRLF outright, so a fresh clone could not pass
# `npm run lint --workspace @billing/web`. Measured, not assumed: a freshly
# checked-out page.tsx came back with 57 CRLF pairs and failed the formatter.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must keep LF even on Windows checkouts, or they break at runtime.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
